flowchart TB
 H[Human Engineer] --> UI[API / Dashboard]
 UI --> O[Workflow Orchestrator]
 O --> S[(Workflow State)]
 O --> R[Requirement Agent]
 O --> REPO[Repository Agent]
 R --> A[Architect Agent]
 REPO --> A
 A --> P[Task Planner]
 P --> DAG[DAG Scheduler]
 DAG --> API[API Agent]
 DAG --> DB[Database Agent]
 DAG --> TEST[Test Design Agent]
 API --> I[Integration Workspace]
 DB --> I
 TEST --> I
 I --> V[Validation Engine]
 V -->|Fail| REC[Recovery Agent]
 REC --> DAG
 V -->|Pass| REV[Review Agent]
 REV --> H
 H -->|Approved| G[Git PR / Reviewable Changes]
 G --> ART[(Artifact Store)]
